flowchart TD
    A[Heaven Issues Mock Appointment] --> B{Wukong Accepts?}
    B -->|No| C[Declares Great Sage Title]
    B -->|Yes, temporarily| D[Inspects Heavenly Stables]
    D --> C
    C --> E[Peach Banquet Breach]
    E --> F[Elixir Hall Breach]
    F --> G{Heavenly Counterattack Effective?}
    G -->|No| H[Deploy Erlang Shen]
    H --> I{Duel Outcome}
    I -->|Stalemate| J[Escalate to High-Level Containment]
    I -->|Wukong Escapes| E
    J --> K[Five Elements Temporary Containment]
    K --> L[Incident Postmortem]

